TerminalComputer: Registering new Hunter candidate...
TerminalComputer: You have now begun the Hunter's Exam. Listen closely.
TerminalComputer: This terminal is reserved for all registered Hunters and is intended for internal use only.
TerminalComputer: Through this terminal, you will become a more powerful Hunter and be granted access to the facilities that will assist you on your climb expeditions.
TerminalComputer: At the top, you will see six colored buttons, each representing a particular skill category. Click on anyone of them to bring up a categories tech tree at any given point.
TerminalComputer: In front of you is a basic 'Attack' Node. Once purchased, it will improve your base damage to monsters by a percentage.
if {current_spirol} >= 50.0:
	TerminalComputer: It appears you have acquired enough spirol to purchase this node. Go ahead and purchase the 'Attack 1' Node.
else:
	TerminalComputer: Hunt those three Mushies behind you. Sell their loot to the merchant and report back here to purchase the node.
	TerminalComputer: Good luck.
[wait time="1.0"]
do CutsceneManager.enable_close_button()